WEBVTT


00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:36.148
The heart...


00:03:44.124 --> 00:03:45.557
...for Smoke Frog.


00:03:45.626 --> 00:03:46.888
Thank you.


00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:55.092
This liver for Curl Nose.


00:03:55.436 --> 00:03:57.165
Thank you.


00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.237
Cocoa Leaf...


00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.570
...the ears.


00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.008
Thank you.


00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:10.440
And for you Blunted...


00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.845
...the balls.


00:04:18.158 --> 00:04:19.284
Not this again.


00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:20.715
I'm helping you.


00:04:20.928 --> 00:04:22.054
Then you eat them!


00:04:22.229 --> 00:04:24.561
I don't need them.
Neither do the rest of the fellows.


00:04:24.665 --> 00:04:25.689
Do you fellows?


00:04:25.766 --> 00:04:26.528
No.


00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.567
Of course not!


00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:28.896
Sometimes!


00:04:29.136 --> 00:04:29.932
What do you think?


00:04:30.304 --> 00:04:31.100
No!


00:04:31.171 --> 00:04:32.069
No, no!


00:04:32.673 --> 00:04:34.436
But how many times does it take?


00:04:34.675 --> 00:04:37.303
I have eight older sisters
and one brother.


00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:41.045
Father took tapir balls all ten times.


00:05:21.622 --> 00:05:22.987
Shall I tell him?


00:05:25.025 --> 00:05:27.323
I'm sorry. The balls are useless.


00:05:29.563 --> 00:05:30.757
You've never had them?


00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:33.532
Couldn't tell you what they taste like.


00:05:34.535 --> 00:05:35.627
None of you?


00:05:37.638 --> 00:05:40.300
No, but it's been fun watching you...


00:05:46.146 --> 00:05:47.170
This was your idea!


00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.447
Get him off me!


00:05:58.325 --> 00:05:59.952
Calm down!


00:06:17.411 --> 00:06:20.380
Why do you let them treat you like this?


00:06:20.914 --> 00:06:22.404
Be strong.


00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:24.482
Where is your pride?


00:06:29.523 --> 00:06:32.583
It all works... Yes?


00:06:36.029 --> 00:06:37.223
Yes...


00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:40.528
...I just can't make children.


00:06:45.973 --> 00:06:48.533
There is something I will tell you...


00:06:49.243 --> 00:06:52.508
...but I warn you, it's very powerful.


00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:54.943
What do you speak of?


00:06:55.749 --> 00:06:57.341
The soanzo leaf.


00:06:58.752 --> 00:07:00.117
The soanzo leaf?


00:07:00.387 --> 00:07:03.049
From the great marshes in the south...


00:07:07.894 --> 00:07:10.920
This is what gave me my ten children.


00:07:17.271 --> 00:07:19.466
No! No! Wait...


00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:23.139
You have to rub them on... down there.


00:07:23.844 --> 00:07:26.108
Just before you next try.


00:07:26.346 --> 00:07:28.405
Apply it generously...


00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:35.079
I don't know how to thank you.


00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:40.253
If this works...
maybe she'll stop bothering me.


00:07:40.694 --> 00:07:41.786
Your wife?


00:07:42.262 --> 00:07:44.093
No, her mother.


00:07:44.431 --> 00:07:46.831
The old hag wants grandchildren.


00:07:56.376 --> 00:07:57.934
Give me some meat.


00:07:58.445 --> 00:08:00.436
Here, work on this...


00:08:00.847 --> 00:08:02.678
...pure meat...


00:08:04.351 --> 00:08:06.683
...ball breath.


00:09:11.118 --> 00:09:12.244
What do you want?


00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:17.987
What do you want?


00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:18.645
I am Flint Sky. I have hunted
this forest from the day I came of age.


00:10:20.153 --> 00:10:24.556
My father hunted this forest
with me and before me.


00:10:26.193 --> 00:10:28.127
Jaguar Paw, my son.


00:10:28.428 --> 00:10:30.760
He hunts this forest with me.


00:10:32.299 --> 00:10:35.791
He will hunt it with his son
after I am gone.


00:10:55.956 --> 00:10:57.321
A good catch?


00:10:58.158 --> 00:11:00.126
Good waters here.


00:11:02.796 --> 00:11:04.263
The forest gives much here.


00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.304
We ask only to pass through.


00:11:13.173 --> 00:11:14.470
Pass.


00:11:20.347 --> 00:11:22.178
Keep safe as you pass.


00:11:25.819 --> 00:11:27.377
Let's go.


00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:06.351
Our lands were ravaged.


00:12:07.227 --> 00:12:09.161
We seek a new beginning.


00:12:16.136 --> 00:12:17.694
Your lands were ravaged?


00:12:21.441 --> 00:12:23.068
Yes...


00:12:24.377 --> 00:12:27.073
We seek a new beginning...


00:12:27.647 --> 00:12:28.909
Be still.


00:12:29.149 --> 00:12:30.081
My son!


00:12:32.085 --> 00:12:33.347
Be still.


00:12:38.491 --> 00:12:39.788
Back to the village.


00:13:13.526 --> 00:13:18.429
I ask you not to speak
of what you saw in the forest today.


00:13:22.335 --> 00:13:24.462
You are troubled.


00:13:24.704 --> 00:13:26.433
Yes, I am.


00:13:42.956 --> 00:13:47.086
Those people in the forest,
what did you see on them?


00:13:47.627 --> 00:13:48.787
I do not understand.


00:13:49.896 --> 00:13:51.363
Fear.


00:13:54.668 --> 00:13:57.637
Deep rotting fear.


00:13:58.204 --> 00:14:00.764
They were infected by it.


00:14:01.641 --> 00:14:02.938
Did you see?


00:14:03.476 --> 00:14:05.637
Fear is a sickness.


00:14:10.917 --> 00:14:15.047
It will crawl into the soul
of anyone who engages it.


00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:21.020
It has tainted your peace already.


00:14:23.229 --> 00:14:27.325
I did not raise you
to see you live with fear.


00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:31.564
Strike it from your heart.


00:14:31.771 --> 00:14:34.467
Do not bring it into our village.


00:14:35.008 --> 00:14:38.637
At first light
we will gather with the elders...


00:14:39.546 --> 00:14:42.674
...at the sacred hill of our fathers.


00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:47.716
There we will call on
their spirits to guide us.


00:14:58.898 --> 00:15:00.593
Oh, here he is!


00:15:01.568 --> 00:15:02.899
The big lump!


00:15:03.737 --> 00:15:05.204
He's useless.


00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.395
He can't do it.


00:15:09.209 --> 00:15:10.699
You! Yes you!


00:15:11.444 --> 00:15:14.845
With your height and your girth.
You have deceived us.


00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:17.177
Get inside!


00:15:22.722 --> 00:15:24.246
Damn you! Get in there!


00:15:24.591 --> 00:15:26.081
Old woman, please.


00:15:26.493 --> 00:15:27.460
Move it!


00:15:31.831 --> 00:15:33.298
You don't work!


00:15:35.835 --> 00:15:37.302
What are you laughing about?


00:15:45.278 --> 00:15:49.772
Give me a grandchild
or I will have you replaced.


00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.815
Mother, that's enough.


00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.914
Do not come out until you make a child.


00:15:58.591 --> 00:16:00.115
Two would be better!


00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.292
What?


00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:04.953
Twins you oaf.


00:16:13.706 --> 00:16:14.468
Mother.


00:16:15.441 --> 00:16:19.775
Can you go away?
He says he can't with you sitting there.


00:16:20.213 --> 00:16:21.578
Just get busy.


00:16:22.849 --> 00:16:24.146
Mom...


00:16:28.788 --> 00:16:30.255
She's gone.


00:17:13.833 --> 00:17:16.563
Mother, what do you say we should
have at the feast tonight?


00:17:16.836 --> 00:17:19.532
I have tapir...
but I also found this boy.


00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:20.968
I say boy.


00:17:21.174 --> 00:17:22.072
Roasted!


00:17:22.342 --> 00:17:24.970
The tapir smells better.
I think it's more fresh.


00:17:25.378 --> 00:17:27.312
No Dad! No! It's me! It's me!


00:17:27.513 --> 00:17:30.311
I'll just hang the boy here
in case we change our minds.


00:17:33.887 --> 00:17:34.581
Wait...


00:17:34.787 --> 00:17:37.654
That's our Turtles Run.
That's our eldest.


00:17:37.857 --> 00:17:40.325
Yes it's me. It's your eldest!


00:17:41.227 --> 00:17:44.526
In that case, a crush for my eldest...


00:17:48.134 --> 00:17:50.432
...and a crush for my youngest.


00:17:51.704 --> 00:17:54.036
Tapir it is.


00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:01.572
One day, old man!


00:19:02.141 --> 00:19:04.439
One day you won't be able
to run anymore!


00:19:22.161 --> 00:19:25.289
And a Man sat alone.


00:19:26.733 --> 00:19:29.258
Drenched deep in sadness.


00:19:29.969 --> 00:19:32.767
And all the animals
drew near to him and said:


00:19:33.406 --> 00:19:37.206
"We do not like to see you so sad...


00:19:39.012 --> 00:19:42.448
"Ask us for whatever you wish
and you shall have it."


00:19:43.483 --> 00:19:47.852
The Man said:
"I want to have good sight."


00:19:49.255 --> 00:19:52.452
The vulture replied:
"You shall have mine."


00:19:55.495 --> 00:19:58.692
The Man said: "I want to be strong."


00:20:02.402 --> 00:20:04.165
The jaguar said:


00:20:06.539 --> 00:20:09.474
"You shall be strong like me."


00:20:11.444 --> 00:20:17.314
Then the Man said: "I long
to know the secrets of the earth."


00:20:18.885 --> 00:20:23.845
The serpent replied:
"I will show them to you."


00:20:25.758 --> 00:20:28.249
And so it went with all the animals.


00:20:29.962 --> 00:20:32.692
And when the Man had
all the gifts that they could give...


00:20:32.899 --> 00:20:34.526
...he left.


00:20:36.102 --> 00:20:38.366
Then the owl said to the other animals:


00:20:39.305 --> 00:20:43.173
"Now the Man knows much
and is able to do many things...


00:20:44.277 --> 00:20:47.610
"Suddenly I am afraid."


00:20:50.817 --> 00:20:53.615
The deer said:
"The Man has all that he needs."


00:20:54.754 --> 00:20:56.745
"Now his sadness will stop."


00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.381
But the owl replied: "No."


00:21:02.061 --> 00:21:04.928
"I saw a hole in the Man...


00:21:05.932 --> 00:21:09.698
"Deep like a hunger
he will never fill...


00:21:10.736 --> 00:21:15.230
"It is what makes him sad
and what makes him want."


00:21:18.511 --> 00:21:21.571
"He will go on taking and taking...


00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:25.979
"Until one day the World will say:


00:21:26.752 --> 00:21:30.882
"I am no more
and I have nothing left to give."


00:22:17.637 --> 00:22:19.468
Come back to me...


00:22:23.809 --> 00:22:25.674
Come back to me.


00:22:54.574 --> 00:22:56.565
My son is dancing.


00:22:58.277 --> 00:23:00.404
Your son is happy.


00:23:52.798 --> 00:23:54.459
What do you want?


00:24:10.483 --> 00:24:12.212
Run!


00:24:27.767 --> 00:24:31.794
Now that you're up,
can you please kill that dog?


00:24:44.950 --> 00:24:47.009
The dog.


00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:16.232
Get up! Get up! Now!


00:27:31.984 --> 00:27:33.576
Go to the forest.


00:27:34.019 --> 00:27:35.850
Run! Do not look back.


00:28:01.647 --> 00:28:03.478
No! No! I am afraid!


00:28:03.849 --> 00:28:05.874
Look into my eyes. Look into my eyes.


00:28:06.218 --> 00:28:07.276
Be strong...


00:28:07.720 --> 00:28:08.812
I am afraid!


00:28:09.421 --> 00:28:10.945
Be strong.


00:29:09.381 --> 00:29:10.245
Tie him up!


00:30:28.394 --> 00:30:29.418
Father!


00:30:30.829 --> 00:30:32.990
The others. I have to help.


00:30:34.133 --> 00:30:35.862
No, don't leave us!


00:30:36.168 --> 00:30:38.830
I will come back, I promise.


00:30:39.138 --> 00:30:40.332
Don't you leave!


00:30:40.639 --> 00:30:41.469
I promise.


00:30:41.540 --> 00:30:42.438
Stay, please stay.


00:30:42.675 --> 00:30:43.801
Father, don't go.


00:31:40.432 --> 00:31:41.831
Very nice.


00:32:28.847 --> 00:32:29.871
Stop!


00:32:38.690 --> 00:32:39.987
Tie him up!


00:32:44.363 --> 00:32:45.762
I want him alive.


00:33:06.318 --> 00:33:07.580
Sorry Father.


00:33:26.705 --> 00:33:28.605
That's enough!


00:33:39.218 --> 00:33:40.981
Stand him up.


00:33:48.727 --> 00:33:50.354
Move away.


00:34:04.209 --> 00:34:05.972
My son.


00:34:16.855 --> 00:34:18.652
Don't be afraid.


00:35:16.982 --> 00:35:19.450
Almost...


00:35:34.366 --> 00:35:36.960
...that's your name.


00:35:37.970 --> 00:35:41.133
"Almost".


00:35:57.022 --> 00:35:59.490
Our life is over.


00:36:04.896 --> 00:36:06.193
Shame...


00:36:14.239 --> 00:36:15.467
Shame!


00:36:19.644 --> 00:36:21.703
Cowards!


00:39:55.393 --> 00:39:57.156
Let's move!


00:42:16.835 --> 00:42:18.200
We move out now.


00:42:18.603 --> 00:42:20.036
They are back.


00:42:23.074 --> 00:42:24.405
Get up!


00:42:27.212 --> 00:42:28.645
Heave!


00:42:35.854 --> 00:42:38.584
Cut Rock, you forgot to duck.


00:42:41.593 --> 00:42:42.890
Hold still.


00:42:52.604 --> 00:42:53.730
Can you see?


00:42:56.141 --> 00:42:57.073
Yes.


00:42:57.542 --> 00:42:59.339
Get back to your line.


00:44:00.772 --> 00:44:01.966
Come with us...


00:44:54.325 --> 00:44:55.519
Get up.


00:45:08.106 --> 00:45:10.370
Leave him alone, "Almost".


00:45:12.544 --> 00:45:14.409
I said get up.


00:45:42.974 --> 00:45:44.703
Up, up...


00:45:45.209 --> 00:45:46.767
...that's it.


00:45:48.913 --> 00:45:50.244
Let's go!


00:45:54.118 --> 00:45:57.019
This man is a good friend of yours...


00:46:31.923 --> 00:46:33.891
Don't worry...


00:46:37.462 --> 00:46:39.430
I'll take care of them.


00:46:42.367 --> 00:46:44.665
They are mine now.


00:46:51.943 --> 00:46:56.004
Gentle lxchel. Tender mother of mercy.


00:46:57.849 --> 00:47:02.980
Keep them from harm. Please. Keep them.


00:47:38.890 --> 00:47:40.482
One more.


00:48:04.115 --> 00:48:05.810
Ready?


00:49:06.744 --> 00:49:08.302
Hold on! Hold on!


00:49:12.250 --> 00:49:13.808
Wait...


00:49:15.353 --> 00:49:17.150
...let's see what happens.


00:49:25.163 --> 00:49:26.061
That's it!


00:49:33.304 --> 00:49:34.498
Hurry!


00:49:35.473 --> 00:49:37.407
Pull! Be strong!


00:49:56.460 --> 00:49:58.291
Yes! You did it!


00:50:02.166 --> 00:50:03.827
Good work!


00:50:16.647 --> 00:50:19.377
Can you breathe? Good.


00:50:49.180 --> 00:50:50.078
Wait here.


00:51:23.447 --> 00:51:25.108
What's become of my capture?


00:51:28.920 --> 00:51:30.353
Dead weight.


00:51:32.056 --> 00:51:34.286
He nearly took the rest with him.


00:51:36.560 --> 00:51:38.255
I let him go.


00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:44.229
You. Let him go?


00:51:51.309 --> 00:51:54.801
Shall we now do what you want?


00:51:59.150 --> 00:52:02.119
Let us try that.


00:52:25.376 --> 00:52:28.174
Don't let any others go.


00:52:34.852 --> 00:52:36.114
Let's move.


00:52:51.402 --> 00:52:53.529
Get up "Almost".


00:52:54.638 --> 00:52:58.199
We don't want to lose you just yet.


00:53:48.392 --> 00:53:50.383
Stand up, boy.


00:53:59.136 --> 00:54:01.661
You proved yourself today, my son.


00:54:02.373 --> 00:54:06.173
You're now worthy to stand
with the rest of us.


00:54:08.746 --> 00:54:11.271
Thank you Father.


00:54:21.325 --> 00:54:22.724
Take it...


00:54:23.461 --> 00:54:24.689
...it's yours.


00:54:28.799 --> 00:54:31.427
It has taken many lives.


00:54:43.814 --> 00:54:45.247
Get some rest.


00:54:59.763 --> 00:55:00.923
Resting brothers...


00:55:01.198 --> 00:55:04.565
...fathers, mothers, wives.


00:55:05.603 --> 00:55:09.767
You felt the cold
of this day's early morning.


00:55:10.708 --> 00:55:14.906
Now you cannot feel
the coldness of its night.


00:55:17.615 --> 00:55:19.606
She stopped screaming...


00:55:21.819 --> 00:55:24.788
...too long before they returned,
she had stopped screaming.


00:55:25.656 --> 00:55:28.318
We saw how she fought them.


00:55:29.360 --> 00:55:31.191
But in the final moment?


00:55:32.796 --> 00:55:34.696
If she let them...


00:55:37.368 --> 00:55:41.998
...the Goddess of the Scaffold
shows no mercy for the weakness...


00:55:44.041 --> 00:55:48.501
Her soul waits for yours
in the shade of the Ceiba Tree.


00:55:59.690 --> 00:56:01.385
I need to know.


00:56:02.893 --> 00:56:07.694
Before this day's end
I will leave this world.


00:56:09.600 --> 00:56:15.061
I will take as many
of these bastard dogs with me as I can.


00:56:17.408 --> 00:56:22.209
And I will gladly embrace
the torments of hell...


00:56:24.381 --> 00:56:27.748
...if I do not find my Sky Flower there.


00:56:34.792 --> 00:56:36.259
Don't rain.


00:57:19.603 --> 00:57:21.400
I am walking here.


00:57:54.204 --> 00:57:56.229
Keep away, she has the sickness.


00:58:21.832 --> 00:58:23.493
Get back!


00:59:16.387 --> 00:59:18.514
You fear me?


00:59:19.923 --> 00:59:22.517
So you should...


00:59:23.193 --> 00:59:26.594
...all you who are vile.


00:59:29.633 --> 00:59:33.160
Would you like to know how you will die?


00:59:40.210 --> 00:59:44.044
The sacred time is near...


00:59:46.216 --> 00:59:50.380
Beware the blackness of day.


00:59:53.590 --> 00:59:58.357
Beware the man who brings the jaguar.


01:00:01.265 --> 01:00:05.929
Behold him reborn from mud and earth...


01:00:07.004 --> 01:00:12.874
For the one he takes you to
will cancel the sky...


01:00:14.011 --> 01:00:16.878
...and scratch out the earth.


01:00:18.015 --> 01:00:20.313
Scratch you out.


01:00:21.585 --> 01:00:24.281
And end your world.


01:00:30.861 --> 01:00:33.989
He's with us now.


01:00:40.971 --> 01:00:43.804
...day will be like night.


01:00:44.341 --> 01:00:48.903
And the man jaguar
will lead you to your end.


01:01:59.883 --> 01:02:02.147
Where are they taking us?


01:02:06.456 --> 01:02:10.859
We tell stories of a place stone-built.


01:02:12.396 --> 01:02:13.920
What happens there?


01:02:14.865 --> 01:02:16.264
I do not know...


01:02:17.801 --> 01:02:21.328
...but the earth bleeds.


01:02:24.374 --> 01:02:26.274
We are near.


01:03:07.985 --> 01:03:09.577
Salvation!


01:03:10.187 --> 01:03:13.247
He has the laughing sickness.


01:03:14.257 --> 01:03:16.282
He likes you!


01:03:18.862 --> 01:03:20.090
Help me!


01:03:28.472 --> 01:03:30.303
Save me.


01:03:38.215 --> 01:03:39.773
Die like a man.


01:06:20.377 --> 01:06:21.469
Welcome back.


01:06:22.612 --> 01:06:24.079
Have you been successful?


01:06:24.681 --> 01:06:25.773
Ask my son.


01:06:27.717 --> 01:06:29.082
How many captives?


01:06:29.319 --> 01:06:30.286
Deal with my son.


01:06:32.389 --> 01:06:33.447
A fair price.


01:06:34.891 --> 01:06:36.654
As always, trust me.


01:06:37.494 --> 01:06:38.153
Good.


01:06:56.012 --> 01:06:58.708
How much will you give me?


01:08:00.443 --> 01:08:02.343
Who will buy this woman?


01:08:03.413 --> 01:08:04.778
No... she's too old.


01:08:06.116 --> 01:08:07.913
She can be useful.


01:08:08.418 --> 01:08:10.113
She can cook... clean...


01:08:11.655 --> 01:08:13.714
Useless old woman!


01:08:17.394 --> 01:08:18.918
No sale.


01:08:24.668 --> 01:08:26.033
Go!


01:08:27.137 --> 01:08:28.399
Go on.


01:13:29.205 --> 01:13:33.505
These are the days of our great lament.


01:13:37.981 --> 01:13:39.881
The land thirsts.


01:13:42.318 --> 01:13:46.721
A great plague infests our crops.


01:13:49.559 --> 01:13:53.620
The scourge of sickness
afflicts us at whim.


01:13:59.636 --> 01:14:03.231
They say this strife has made us weak.


01:14:05.475 --> 01:14:07.306
That we have become empty.


01:14:10.113 --> 01:14:12.377
They say that we rot.


01:14:24.093 --> 01:14:26.960
Great people of the banner of the sun...


01:14:27.797 --> 01:14:29.264
I say...


01:14:30.466 --> 01:14:32.263
...we are strong.


01:14:36.773 --> 01:14:38.832
We are a people of destiny.


01:14:43.646 --> 01:14:46.911
Destined to be the masters of time.


01:14:50.987 --> 01:14:54.252
Destined to be nearest to the gods.


01:15:10.206 --> 01:15:13.334
Mighty Kukulkan!


01:15:14.977 --> 01:15:19.505
Whose fury could scorch
this earth to oblivion...


01:15:22.151 --> 01:15:24.449
Let us appease you with this sacrifice.


01:15:25.054 --> 01:15:26.851
To exalt you in your glory.


01:15:27.724 --> 01:15:30.318
To make our people prosper.


01:15:31.427 --> 01:15:34.157
To prepare for your return.


01:15:37.233 --> 01:15:39.997
Warrior, unafraid and willing!


01:15:40.570 --> 01:15:42.902
With your blood you renew the world!


01:15:43.439 --> 01:15:45.236
From age to age.


01:15:46.676 --> 01:15:48.303
Thanks be to you.


01:16:03.059 --> 01:16:05.220
The heart of god!


01:18:48.956 --> 01:18:51.220
Come back to me.


01:19:00.168 --> 01:19:02.033
Brother...


01:19:03.938 --> 01:19:05.735
Journey well...


01:19:07.909 --> 01:19:08.807
No.


01:19:10.311 --> 01:19:11.437
I can't go.


01:19:12.980 --> 01:19:14.538
Not now...


01:21:34.288 --> 01:21:39.123
People of the banner
of the sun do not fear.


01:21:40.061 --> 01:21:41.892
Rejoice!


01:21:43.164 --> 01:21:46.190
Kukulkan has drunk his fill of blood.


01:21:46.567 --> 01:21:49.365
We have sated his thirst.


01:21:50.505 --> 01:21:52.200
Great god.


01:21:53.174 --> 01:21:55.404
Show us that you are pleased.


01:21:55.676 --> 01:21:59.271
Let your light return upon us.


01:23:04.645 --> 01:23:06.704
What of these captives?


01:23:11.419 --> 01:23:13.319
Dispose of them.


01:23:47.755 --> 01:23:49.916
I need a finisher.


01:23:54.962 --> 01:23:56.259
You.


01:24:02.370 --> 01:24:03.928
Release them.


01:24:12.213 --> 01:24:13.840
You watch.


01:24:34.735 --> 01:24:35.793
I'm ready!


01:24:40.808 --> 01:24:43.777
There's your jungle beyond the corn.


01:24:46.747 --> 01:24:48.146
Go to it.


01:24:48.983 --> 01:24:50.382
You're free...


01:24:52.253 --> 01:24:53.618
...now run.


01:24:56.957 --> 01:24:58.288
I said run.


01:25:02.697 --> 01:25:03.959
Run!


01:26:17.605 --> 01:26:18.697
Not bad.


01:26:36.857 --> 01:26:38.188
Your turn.


01:26:46.033 --> 01:26:47.557
Run.


01:28:03.444 --> 01:28:04.911
Run!


01:29:19.420 --> 01:29:20.978
Sleep.


01:29:21.956 --> 01:29:24.186
Sleep, sleep now my son.


01:29:25.259 --> 01:29:27.591
The pain will be no more.


01:29:29.563 --> 01:29:30.825
Sleep.


01:35:20.914 --> 01:35:23.041
He didn't come this way.


01:35:36.330 --> 01:35:38.298
He's in the trees.


01:35:40.067 --> 01:35:41.295
Spread out.


01:35:42.169 --> 01:35:43.693
Keep your eyes up.


01:36:06.093 --> 01:36:07.151
Quiet.


01:36:18.772 --> 01:36:19.966
He's coming right at us.


01:36:36.690 --> 01:36:37.349
There!


01:38:35.575 --> 01:38:38.305
He would have wanted me to have it.


01:38:40.480 --> 01:38:43.415
The omen is bad...


01:38:45.352 --> 01:38:48.412
Mighty Ek Chuah we beg you...


01:38:49.689 --> 01:38:53.921
Forgive us for this trespass
against your son the Jaguar.


01:38:55.929 --> 01:38:58.420
The omen is bad...


01:39:00.166 --> 01:39:02.134
Lift yourself up Drunkards Four...


01:39:03.003 --> 01:39:05.995
...the omen was foretold...


01:39:08.375 --> 01:39:11.572
...and now we have a fear more grave...


01:39:12.546 --> 01:39:15.947
...today I saw the day
become like night...


01:39:22.489 --> 01:39:26.118
I saw a man run with the Jaguar...


01:39:30.030 --> 01:39:34.126
...we must not let this man
make feet from us.


01:39:34.868 --> 01:39:36.028
Enough.


01:39:39.806 --> 01:39:41.671
Your words mean nothing.


01:39:43.043 --> 01:39:45.273
He runs because he is afraid.


01:39:46.646 --> 01:39:50.275
When I catch him,
I will peel his skin...


01:39:53.320 --> 01:39:56.050
...and have him watch me wear it.


01:40:03.763 --> 01:40:04.991
We leave now.


01:42:12.625 --> 01:42:13.819
Stay back.


01:43:24.764 --> 01:43:25.890
Here!


01:43:50.456 --> 01:43:52.583
The omen was bad...


01:43:56.296 --> 01:43:57.422
He's fucked.


01:44:00.733 --> 01:44:02.132
Help... please...


01:44:02.969 --> 01:44:04.231
Hanging Moss...


01:44:05.905 --> 01:44:07.532
See him out.


01:44:27.994 --> 01:44:31.657
Open your veins. It's quicker.


01:44:44.377 --> 01:44:46.470
Travel well.


01:47:52.298 --> 01:47:55.028
So much for your prophecies.


01:48:00.907 --> 01:48:02.135
It's not over!


01:48:28.167 --> 01:48:29.794
I am Jaguar Paw...


01:48:30.503 --> 01:48:32.061
Son of Flint Sky...


01:48:33.506 --> 01:48:36.873
My father hunted
this forest before me...


01:48:38.611 --> 01:48:40.579
My name is Jaguar Paw.


01:48:41.414 --> 01:48:43.006
I am a hunter.


01:48:44.617 --> 01:48:46.881
This is my forest.


01:48:48.054 --> 01:48:52.582
And my sons will hunt it
with their sons after I am gone...


01:48:55.461 --> 01:48:56.689
Come on!


01:48:59.365 --> 01:49:01.060
We are going over.


01:49:01.634 --> 01:49:04.364
We climb down around.


01:49:05.638 --> 01:49:07.731
We cannot let him get away.


01:49:08.441 --> 01:49:09.567
We cannot afford...


01:49:29.795 --> 01:49:31.922
We all jump.


01:52:28.941 --> 01:52:30.568
I am Jaguar Paw.


01:52:32.445 --> 01:52:34.276
This is my forest.


01:52:36.349 --> 01:52:39.045
And I am not afraid.


01:54:46.479 --> 01:54:49.039
You go. I'll wait here.


02:00:18.577 --> 02:00:20.374
Almost...


02:00:47.239 --> 02:00:49.935
Resting fathers, fly me your strength.


02:01:16.969 --> 02:01:18.732
Get up here.


02:01:33.619 --> 02:01:35.177
Go back!


02:02:04.583 --> 02:02:05.277
Quick!


02:02:05.884 --> 02:02:06.851
Hurry up!


02:08:33.705 --> 02:08:35.570
What are they?


02:08:37.242 --> 02:08:39.073
They bring men.


02:08:43.715 --> 02:08:45.615
Should we go to them?


02:08:53.925 --> 02:08:55.722
We should go to the forest.


02:09:02.634 --> 02:09:04.534
To seek a new beginning.

